  "verseCount": 40,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "7",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Issachar",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Issachar:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 7:1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tola, Puah, Jashub and Shimron—four in all.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Tola:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 7:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Uzzi, Rephaiah, Jeriel, Jahmai, Ibsam and Samuel—heads of their families. During the reign of David, the descendants of Tola listed as fighting men in their genealogy numbered 22,600.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The son of Uzzi:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 7:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Izrahiah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "1CH 7:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The sons of Izrahiah:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 7:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Michael, Obadiah, Joel and Ishiah. All five of them were chiefs.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "According to their family genealogy, they had 36,000 men ready for battle, for they had many wives and children.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "lf"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The relatives who were fighting men belonging to all the clans of Issachar, as listed in their genealogy, were 87,000 in all.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Benjamin",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Three sons of Benjamin:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 7:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bela, Beker and Jediael.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Bela:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 7:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ezbon, Uzzi, Uzziel, Jerimoth and Iri, heads of families—five in all. Their genealogical record listed 22,034 fighting men.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Beker:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 7:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Zemirah, Joash, Eliezer, Elioenai, Omri, Jeremoth, Abijah, Anathoth and Alemeth. All these were the sons of Beker.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Their genealogical record listed the heads of families and 20,200 fighting men.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The son of Jediael:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 7:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bilhan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "1CH 7:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The sons of Bilhan:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 7:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jeush, Benjamin, Ehud, Kenaanah, Zethan, Tarshish and Ahishahar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All these sons of Jediael were heads of families. There were 17,200 fighting men ready to go out to war.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Shuppites and Huppites were the descendants of Ir, and the Hushites",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "the descendants of Aher.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Naphtali",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Naphtali:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 7:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jahziel, Guni, Jezer and Shillem",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "—the descendants of Bilhah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Manasseh",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The descendants of Manasseh:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 7:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Asriel was his descendant through his Aramean concubine. She gave birth to Makir the father of Gilead.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makir took a wife from among the Huppites and Shuppites. His sister's name was Maakah. Another descendant was named Zelophehad, who had only daughters.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makir's wife Maakah gave birth to a son and named him Peresh. His brother was named Sheresh, and his sons were Ulam and Rakem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The son of Ulam:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 7:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bedan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "1CH 7:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "These were the sons of Gilead son of Makir, the son of Manasseh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "His sister Hammoleketh gave birth to Ishhod, Abiezer and Mahlah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Shemida were:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 7:19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahian, Shechem, Likhi and Aniam.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ephraim",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The descendants of Ephraim:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 7:20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shuthelah, Bered his son,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 7:20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tahath his son, Eleadah his son,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 7:20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tahath his son,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zabad his son",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 7:21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and Shuthelah his son.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 7:21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Ezer and Elead were killed by the native-born men of Gath, when they went down to seize their livestock.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Their father Ephraim mourned for them many days, and his relatives came to comfort him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he made love to his wife again, and she became pregnant and gave birth to a son. He named him Beriah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "because there had been misfortune in his family.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "His daughter was Sheerah, who built Lower and Upper Beth Horon as well as Uzzen Sheerah.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rephah was his son, Resheph his son,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 7:25"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Telah his son, Tahan his son,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ladan his son, Ammihud his son,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
